1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 20th generation. Approximately 1680 BC to _____. Son of Fen (芬). Also known as Ju (局).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Xia (夏) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Qin (勤).
2 CONT
2 CONT 二十世。约公元前1680 ---。芬之子, 勤之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 夏帝扃 (公元前1643 - 公元前1626) 的统治基本上维持着较为稳定的局面。对东部的夷族的统治也基本可以维持。
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - In the genealogy of Huang Shou Gong (黄守恭), Shu (蜀) was shown as Ju (局). For the purpose of my family tree, I had adopted the name recorded in our Family Genealogy Book, Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu, (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
