1 NAME HUANG Zu Jia, 黄祖甲 25A
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 25th generation. Approximately 1550 BC to _____. Son of Liang Bo (梁伯).
2 CONT
2 CONT Conferred title of Marquis of Jiangxia (江夏侯) by Shang Emperor Wo Ding (商帝沃丁) around 1525 BC. Established the Huang State (黄国) for the 3rd time in Jiangxia (在江夏黄陂第三次建黄国).
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Ru Hong (汝鸿).
2 CONT
2 CONT 二十五世。约公元前1550 ---。梁伯之子, 汝鸿之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 在江夏黄陂第三次建黄国。
2 CONT
2 CONT 约公元前1525商帝沃丁封伊尹的后代祖甲于江夏黄陂, 国名为黄国, 爵位为侯。因此后代称伊尹为黄尹。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
