1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 35th Ancestor: 進林 (Jìn Lín)''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 1355 BC. At first, he was the 刺史 (Cì Shǐ) of 田東 (Tián Dōng), then he moved to 相國公 (Xiāng Guó Gōng). His tomb was located at the east of ZiWuGu.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wives were 牛 (Niú) and 米 (Mǐ).
2 CONT
2 CONT 牛 (Niú)'s sons were 金郁 (Jīn Yù) and 穗明 (Suì Míng).
2 CONT
2 CONT 米 (Mǐ) had a son named 余慶 (Yú Qìng) and two daughters.
