1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 45th Generation Ancestor: 來富 (Lái Fù)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 1039 BC, during the Western Zhou Dynasty. He occupied the position as the ruler of Tan County for 31 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, 水 (Shuǐ), had three sons named 有發 (Yǒu Fā), 有德 (Yǒu Dé), 有能 (Yǒu Néng). She was buried at the North of Taishan Mountain with her husband.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lái Fù continued the edition of the lineage and established the next eight generation's surname characters. They are 國傳來有 (Guó Chuán Lái Yǒu), 四季平員 (Sì Jì Píng Yuán).
2 CONT
2 CONT The fifth edition of the lineage.
2 CONT
2 CONT The 45th Generation Ancestor, the Chief Editor was 來富 (Lái Fù). He finished the record of the 43rd Generation to the 47th Generation. 
