1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 61st generation ancestor: Zhanmei (占梅)''' - Page 249 to 250
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 583 BC during Eastern Zhou. His tomb was Wugong at Shangtang (上塘), located at Wugong Ling (吳公領) facing towards the east. He was buried at Yitong Ling (亦全嶺) facing the north.
2 CONT
2 CONT Xiyi (希亦) and His wife Ms Li (孝) had two sons, Xiyi (希亦) and  Fuyi (富亦).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Google Translation:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第61代祖先：占美（Zhanmei）'''-第249至250頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 他出生於公元前583年東周時期。 他的墳墓是朝東的吳公領（Wugong Ling）的上塘（Shangtang）的武功。 他被埋葬在朝北的亦全嶺（Yitong Ling）。
2 CONT
2 CONT 希亦和他的妻子李女士有兩個兒子，希亦和富亦。
