1 NAME HUANG Shi Mi, 黄世宓 54A
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 54th generation. Approximately 796 BC to _____. Son of Jun Ya (君牙). Name could have been just Mi (宓).
2 CONT
2 CONT Was born during a turbulent epoch of the Eastern Zhou (东周) period. The name was given by his father, Jun Ya (君牙), in the hope of bringing calm and safety.
2 CONT
2 CONT Supreme Imperial Official in charge of Records (太尉掌史) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Spring-Autumn (春秋) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Xing (铏).
2 CONT
2 CONT 五十四世。约公元前796 ---。君牙之子, 铏之父。周幽王时 (公元前781 - 公元前771) 为长史。
2 CONT
2 CONT 周宣王晚年, 周王朝重新出现了衰像。宣王干涉鲁国的君位继承, 用武力强立鲁孝公 (公元前796) 引起诸侯不睦。君牙 (约公元前820 ---) 为大司徒, 约公元前796年生下孩子时希望天下能安宁, 以宓为孩子名字。宓, 安也。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  黄正瑞的博客.
