2 CONT
2 CONT From Head of Department to Minister of Religious Ceremonies (为庶尹迁宗伯) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Warring States (战国) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Advised the Emperor to rule wisely and to control the foreign tribes to achieve effective control of the country..
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 3 sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT 六十八世。约公元前450 ---。陈之子, 扁之父。东周/战国时期为庶尹, 逼 (近) 宗伯。
2 CONT
2 CONT 众官之长, 接近宗伯之职。掌礼制。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
