2 CONT Lived during the Western Han (西汉) Dynasty. Kept a low profile and avoided conflicts and lived as a recluse (避乱隐居).
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 5 sons，Ba (霸) being the youngest.
2 CONT
2 CONT 七十七世。公元前165 - ？。公卿之子, 霸之父。避乱隐居, 有五子, 季为霸。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 . 黄正瑞的博客
