1 CONT Xian Consort (??), Xu Hui (??) 
1 CONT Consort Yang I (??) 
1 CONT Consort Yang II (??) 
1 CONT Yang-shi (??) 
1 CONT Consort Yin (??) 
1 CONT Consort Yan (??) 
1 CONT Secondary Consort Wei (???) 
1 CONT Wang-shi (??) 
1 CONT He had fourteen sons (in order):
1 CONT
